Placeholder: file not yet converted to PNG.

This is a text placeholder named architecture.png because SVG-to-PNG conversion tools are not available in this environment.

To generate a proper PNG locally, install ImageMagick or librsvg and run one of the commands below:

ImageMagick (Windows / PowerShell):
choco install imagemagick -y
magick docs/architecture.svg docs/architecture.png

librsvg (WSL / Linux):
sudo apt install librsvg2-bin
rsvg-convert -o docs/architecture.png docs/architecture.svg
